<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Lesson Plan Submission Reminder</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: #dc2626; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; }
    .content { background: #f7fafc; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #dc2626; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 15px; }
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #718096; font-size: 12px; }
    .info-box { background: #fee2e2; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 15px 0; }
    .highlight-box { background: #fef3c7; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 15px 0; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Lesson Plan Submission Reminder</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <strong>Training Attended:</strong> {{trainingTitle}}
      </div>

      {{#if customMessage}}
      <p>{{customMessage}}</p>
      {{else}}
      <p>This is a reminder to submit your lesson plan for the training you attended. Your lesson plan helps document how you will apply the training knowledge in your teaching.</p>
      {{/if}}

      <div class="highlight-box">
        <strong>Why is the Lesson Plan important?</strong><br>
        The lesson plan demonstrates how you will integrate the training knowledge into your curriculum and teaching practices.
      </div>

      <p>Your lesson plan should include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>How the training connects to your current courses</li>
        <li>New skills/technologies you will introduce</li>
        <li>Learning objectives for students</li>
        <li>Hands-on activities planned</li>
        <li>Assessment methods</li>
        <li>Implementation timeline</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Please submit your lesson plan at the earliest to complete your training requirements.</p>

      <p>Best regards,<br>Training Coordinator</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated reminder from your Training Coordinator.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
